n> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (4) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Equivalent to: <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">byte</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw1\">static_cast</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>l<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">|</span> <span class=\"kw1\">static_cast</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>r<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Equivalent to: <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">byte</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw1\">static_cast</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>l<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">static_cast</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>r<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> Equivalent to: <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">byte</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw1\">static_cast</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>l<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">^</span> <span class=\"kw1\">static_cast</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>r<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">4)</span> Equivalent to: <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">byte</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>~<span class=\"kw1\">static_cast</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>b<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>\n</div></div>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>A numeric value <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n</span></code> can be converted to a byte value using <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">byte</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span>n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></span></code>, due to C++17 <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/enum#enum_relaxed_init_cpp17\">relaxed enum class initialization</a> rules.\n</p><p>A byte can be converted to a numeric value (such as to produce an integer hash of an object) the usual way with an <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/explicit_cast\">explicit conversion</a> or alternatively with <a href=\"#Non-member_functions\"><code>std::to_integer</code></a>.\n